### Ford Conecta — coleção de requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
### Rode na ordem. Faça o login primeiro para popular {{token}}.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login (admin) — captura o token
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fordconecta.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Perfil do usuário autenticado
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Auto-cadastro (papel customer)
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente App",
  "email": "cliente@example.com",
  "password": "Cliente@123"
}

### Listar clientes (paginado)
GET {{api}}/customers?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar cliente
# @name novoCliente
POST {{api}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro Almeida",
  "document": "66666666666",
  "email": "pedro@example.com",
  "phone": "+5511988887777",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "state": "SP"
}

###
@customerId = {{novoCliente.response.body.id}}

### Listar concessionárias
# @name dealers
GET {{api}}/dealerships
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar veículo
POST {{api}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vin": "9BFZK54P5J8000777",
  "model": "Ranger",
  "modelYear": 2025,
  "purchaseDate": "2025-04-10",
  "odometer": 500,
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}"
}

### Veículos de um cliente
GET {{api}}/vehicles/customer/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Predição — perfil "fiel" (à vista, garantia longa, maduro)
POST {{api}}/predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "age": 52,
  "monthlyIncome": 15000,
  "vehiclePrice": 180000,
  "paymentMethod": "cash",
  "region": "Sudeste",
  "purchaseChannel": "dealership",
  "hasTradeIn": true,
  "warrantyMonths": 48
}

### Predição — perfil "abandono" (financiado, esticado, garantia mínima)
POST {{api}}/predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "age": 24,
  "monthlyIncome": 4000,
  "vehiclePrice": 120000,
  "paymentMethod": "financing",
  "region": "Sudeste",
  "purchaseChannel": "online",
  "hasTradeIn": false,
  "warrantyMonths": 6
}

### Lista de risco (Cockpit) — ordenada por maior risco
GET {{api}}/predictions?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- CASOS DE ERRO (para demonstrar tratamento) ---

### 401 — sem token
GET {{api}}/customers

### 400 — validação (CPF inválido, e-mail inválido, campos faltando)
POST {{api}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "x", "document": "123", "email": "naoémail" }

### 404 — recurso inexistente
GET {{api}}/customers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
